  "details": "1. Launch VRChat in VR mode (via SteamVR in this case, in case that matters).\n\n2. Go into the radial menu OSC menu and press \"Reset Config\".\n\nWhat actually happens:\n\nNothing.\n\nWhat should happen:\n\nThe OSC config should be cleared for that avatar and the avatar should reload.\n\nSeems to only affect VR mode, it works fine when in desktop mode. Perhaps some OSC program is holding a lock on the file or something? I am running Virtual Desktop, Amethyst, and XSOverlay when in VR mode.",
